  "name": "Lost Thunder Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Lost Thunder prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 20–21 and 27–28 October 2018, and later sold in shops. Each box held four Lost Thunder booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Lost Thunder logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Ampharos and Naganadel, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
